<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He, midst His brethren, strikes the note of praise;</l><l>We hear His song, our hearts responsive swell;</l><l>And on this day when He His voice doth raise,</l><l>In spirit we do join and praise Thee well.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Chosen in Him Thy well-beloved Son,</l><l>We have our part in joy before Thy face;</l><l>Predestined, ere this world had yet begun,</l><l>For that blest world, where all bespeaks Thy grace.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Sons loved and loving, whom Thy Spirit fills,</l><l>Our endless portion Christ in us to be;</l><l>Each with some trait of Him whose love us thrills,</l><l>For Thy delight and joy eternally.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
